  "testId": "testim-migrated/tests/webstore/checkout/validate-product-types-in-order-summary-section-for-guest-user.spec.ts > Webstore - Checkout > validate product types in order summary section for guest user",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Guest adds one product of each type (simple, bundle, grouped, configurable; qty 2 each), checks the cart line names, checks out as guest with Custom Flat Rate shipping, removes an auto-applied voucher if present, checks that the line totals add up to the sub total and the order-total math, checks the Purchase Order payment label, and places a COD order.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore as a guest.",
      "For each of the four products: addProductOfAnyType(sku, 2).",
      "Open the cart: 'Cart' heading; productNameLink(id) contains name for each product.",
      "Checkout as Guest; check the configurable line name (product id '532' hardcoded); fill the guest address; check and click the Custom Flat Rate label; remove voucher voucherNumber if present.",
      "Read the four line totals by hardcoded product ids 532/142/408/415 and the summary amounts; sub total = sum of line totals; order-total math; amount to be paid if a voucher is present; PurchaseOrder payment label text.",
      "Select COD, place the order, check the thank-you banner."
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "product",
      "shipping",
      "payment",
      "cart",
      "order"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [
      "Guest cart filled with the four products",
      "A guest order is placed (COD)"
    ],
    "assertions": [
      "Cart heading equals 'Cart'; each productNameLink(id) contains its name",
      "'Proceed to Checkout'; configurable line name equals configurableProductName",
      "Flat shipping label contains 'Custom Flat Rate'; Handling Charges visible",
      "|sum of line totals - sub total| <= 0.05; order-total math within 0.05; amount to be paid math when a voucher shows",
      "paymentLabel(PurchaseOrder) text equals 'PurchaseOrder'; thank-you banner"
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Title and the four step labels match the flow; guest storageState.",
      "tda rows: z-2200010 = PimProductId 415 SimpleProduct; z-1234579 = 142 BundleProduct; z-2200003 = 408 GroupedProduct; B-100004 = 676 ConfigurableProduct whose line id 532 and name are its default variant z-2510001 ('75-Watt Equivalent BR40 ...').",
      "Keys: PRODUCT_SIMPLE_IN_STOCK / PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IN_STOCK / PRODUCT_GROUPED_IN_STOCK (outputs sku, productId, name) and PRODUCT_CONFIGURABLE_WITH_VARIANTS (parentProductSku, variant1Name; variantAttributes BulbSize,Color,Technology as in the approved cart entries), quantityUsed 2 each.",
      "Missing output: the configurable key returns no productId for the variant line (532).",
      "customFlatRateLabel 'Custom Flat Rate' is the FLAT shipping method's description: data of the shipping need (output expectedShippingOptionName). tda rows: FLAT is Custom, DestinationCountryCode US, so countries 'us'.",
      "selectCOD/codRadio pays with COD (txtCOD): PAYMENT_COD_ON_STORE. No source carries the COD code the page object uses, so the need has no data source.",
      "MISSING KEY: Purchase Order payment offered on the store to the guest (Anonymous) profile; need left out, paymentMethodLabel kept as expected-output.",
      "voucherNumber TJD1K8YCH7 is only passed to removeVoucherByNumberIfPresent (removes an auto-applied voucher when its number matches): config, not a record the test needs.",
      "Profile (atstage 2026-10-31) has no observations for the checkout specs: every source is profiled false. Values were checked read-only with `tda rows` where noted.",
      "Store MaxwellsHardware: the store every migrated webstore spec runs on (as in the approved shopping-cart and PDP entries); not named in the scan.",
      "Guest address (masked) is typed into the guest order: created-by-test.",
      "Data in code: product ids '532' (line 84, find by id) and '532', '142', '408', '415' (lines 105-108, readTotal) are hardcoded in the spec; comments at lines 62, 70 and 105-108 name the SKUs.",
      "migrate: product ids are hardcoded in the spec code and the configurable variant's productId has no key output (swap rules 2 and 4 fail). Pre-survey flag confirmed."
    ],
    "confidence": "low",
    "needsReview": true
  },
